# ```
#
# ## HANDOFF CONSTRUCTION & LIFECYCLE
# When delegating to an OpenCode subagent, use this schema. Post via:
# `omega-hub_hivemind_submit_handoff(target_channel="opencode", ...)`
#
# **HandoffPacket Schema**:
# ```
# source: cline/omega-engine
# target: opencode/<entity>
# priority: 0|1|2        # 0=normal, 1=high, 2=critical
# task: |
#   <concise one-line description of what to do>
# context: |
#   <relevant background, files modified, decisions made, trace_id>
# expected_output: |
#   <what the target agent must produce (file path, data structure, report)>
# relevant_files:
#   - <paths the target needs to read or modify>
# dependencies:
#   - <pending work the target must wait for>
# ```
#
# **Lifecycle**:
# 1. **Submit**: `hivemind_submit_handoff(...)` -> creates pending packet
# 2. **Accept**: Target agent calls `hivemind_accept_handoff(packet_id)` -> moves to active
# 3. **Complete**: Target agent calls `hivemind_complete_handoff(packet_id, result)` -> moves to completed
#
# Full protocol: `docs/strategy/SUBAGENT_DISPATCH_PROTOCOL.md`
#
# ## EMERGENCY PROTOCOLS
#
# ### 4-Tier Compaction Recovery (after context loss)
# **Tier 1 — Re-anchor Identity**:
#   Read this `.clinerules` file. Read `head -30 OMEGA_ENGINE.md`.
# **Tier 2 — Re-anchor Engine State**:
#   `head -30 SOVEREIGN_MANDATES.md`. `head -20 PIVOT_LOG.md`.
#   `git log --oneline -5`. `git status`.
# **Tier 3 — Re-anchor Session Continuity**:
#   Read `.opencode/anchored-summary.md` (M15 anchor).
#   Read `data/coordination/{ENTITY}_LIVE_FEED.md` (if it exists).
#   Read `data/entities/<entity>/workspace/session_gnosis.md` (M15 anchor).
# **Tier 4 — Re-anchor Team & Environment**:
#   `omega-hub_hivemind_get_awareness()`. Check `data/coordination/locks/`.
#   `make test` to verify environment integrity.
#   If all 4 tiers pass, proceed. If any fails, STOP and rebuild from OMEGA_ENGINE.md.
#
# ### Lifeboat (if context is critically corrupted)
# 1. `git stash` any uncommitted work
# 2. `git checkout main && git pull`
# 3. Read `.opencode/anchored-summary.md`
# 4. Read `data/coordination/{ENTITY}_LIVE_FEED.md` (last entry timestamp)
# 5. `omega-hub_hivemind_get_continuation(channel="cline", entity="<you>")`
# 6. Resume from last known task
#
